WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:13.149
One day Hope walked into her room.

2
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:18.806
Robot watched her walk back and forth.

3
00:00:18.807 --> 00:00:22.738
Then she sat on the bed.

4
00:00:22.739 --> 00:00:28.686
"Hope seems worried," Robot thought.

5
00:00:28.687 --> 00:00:31.808
Hope tapped her fingers on the nightstand.

6
00:00:31.809 --> 00:00:34.941
Robot wanted to try to help her again.

7
00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:37.931
But he didn't know what was wrong.

8
00:00:37.932 --> 00:00:41.153
Mom came into the room.

9
00:00:41.154 --> 00:00:44.180
She sat on the bed next to Hope.

10
00:00:44.181 --> 00:00:46.696
"Are you okay, honey?"

11
00:00:46.697 --> 00:00:48.522
Hope looked at Mom.

12
00:00:48.523 --> 00:00:51.705
"We have show-and-tell at school tomorrow."

13
00:00:51.706 --> 00:00:54.938
"That sounds fun," Mom said.

14
00:00:54.939 --> 00:00:57.682
"Show-and-tell?" Robot thought.

15
00:00:57.683 --> 00:01:00.993
"Once Henry brought me to school.

16
00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:04.275
He showed everyone my lights and claw!

17
00:01:04.276 --> 00:01:07.307
Maybe Hope will bring me too!"

18
00:01:07.308 --> 00:01:11.595
"I want to bring my favorite MechaTron comic," Hope said.

19
00:01:11.596 --> 00:01:15.826
"But . . . what if the other kids don't like MechaTron?"

20
00:01:15.827 --> 00:01:17.998
Robot thought of Julia.

21
00:01:17.999 --> 00:01:21.146
She didn't like MechaTron.

22
00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:25.730
Julia didn't like Robot either.

23
00:01:25.731 --> 00:01:29.272
"But Hope likes me," Robot thought.

24
00:01:29.273 --> 00:01:34.037
"I'm sure lots of kids like MechaTron," Mom said.

25
00:01:34.038 --> 00:01:38.580
"And people don't have to like the same things."

26
00:01:38.581 --> 00:01:42.148
"That's true," Hope said slowly.

27
00:01:42.149 --> 00:01:45.245
"Choose me, Hope!" Robot thought.

28
00:01:45.246 --> 00:01:48.138
"Not MechaTron!"

29
00:01:48.139 --> 00:01:54.508
"The sea monster drawings are really cool," Hope said.

30
00:01:54.509 --> 00:01:58.635
"Maybe I'll just bring the comic and see what happens."

31
00:01:58.636 --> 00:02:01.797
"No!" Robot thought.

32
00:02:01.798 --> 00:02:05.630
"Pick me, Hope! Please!"

33
00:02:05.631 --> 00:02:09.343
Mom smiled. "That's my girl.

34
00:02:09.344 --> 00:02:13.605
You can tell the kids about Dan Klee too."

35
00:02:13.606 --> 00:02:18.092
Hope went over to her comics shelf.

36
00:02:18.093 --> 00:02:24.135
"Oh well," Robot thought with a sigh.

37
00:02:24.136 --> 00:02:27.695
"Maybe Hope will bring me next time."

38
00:02:27.696 --> 00:02:30.641
"Oh no!" Hope cried.

39
00:02:30.642 --> 00:02:33.484
"What's wrong?" Mom asked.

40
00:02:33.485 --> 00:02:37.185
"I can't bring my favorite comic," Hope said.

41
00:02:37.186 --> 00:02:43.531
"It's not here!"

